<title>UK: BOE invites fixed rate ops, shortage 750 mln stg.</title>
<headline>BOE invites fixed rate ops, shortage 750 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England invited a round of fixed rate operations and revised its shortage forecast to 750 million stg from the initial 650 million.</p>
<p>Operations will comprise 6.0 percent repos to April 1 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before April 1.</p>
</text>
